---
import FunnelLayout from '../../layouts/FunnelLayout.astro';
import FunnelHeader from '../../components/FunnelHeader.astro';
import BrandLogo from '../../components/BrandLogo.astro';
import TemplateStack from '../../components/TemplateStack.astro';
import '../../styles/offer-funnel.css';
import { bookedArtistSystemTiers } from '../../data/booking-funnel/booked-artist-system';
import { EDITIONS, SALES_INTRO } from '../../../lib/offer-quiz.mjs';
const tiers=[...bookedArtistSystemTiers].sort((a,b)=>Number(b.recommended)-Number(a.recommended));
const faqs=[
  {question:'Will this fit the way I work?',answer:'Yes. The system is designed to adapt to your working style and the career you want to build.'},
  {question:'What if I’m busy, but want different work?',answer:'That’s exactly who this is for, too. A full calendar should move you toward the income and creative work you want.'},
  {question:'What do I get?',answer:'A digital package with your edition’s numbered templates and guides, ready to download and keep.'},
  {question:'Which edition should I choose?',answer:'Working System is our recommendation for most artists. Essentials offers a smaller starting point; Complete gives you the greatest depth. Each higher edition includes everything below it.'},
  {question:'Is there a subscription?',answer:'No. Pay once for the edition you choose: Essentials $27, Working System $47, or Complete System $77. Prices are in USD.'},
  {question:'What if it’s not a fit?',answer:'You have a 30-day satisfaction guarantee. Email syd@tatassist.com from your purchase address to request a refund. See the product terms for details.'},
  {question:'Can my whole studio use it?',answer:'Each purchase covers one working artist. Email syd@tatassist.com for multi-artist use.'},
];
const structuredData=[
 {'@context':'https://schema.org','@type':'Product',name:'The Booked Artist System',description:'Numbered tattoo inquiry and booking tools by Joker Ink. Essentials: 6 tools. Working System: 13 tools. Complete System: 22 tools.',brand:{'@type':'Brand',name:'Tatassist'},offers:tiers.map(t=>({'@type':'Offer',name:t.name,priceCurrency:'USD',price:t.price.toFixed(2),availability:t.checkoutUrl?'https://schema.org/InStock':'https://schema.org/PreOrder',url:new URL(`/lp/booked-artist?edition=${t.id}`,Astro.site).toString()}))},
 {'@context':'https://schema.org','@type':'FAQPage',mainEntity:faqs.map(({question,answer})=>({'@type':'Question',name:question,acceptedAnswer:{'@type':'Answer',text:answer}}))},
];
---
<FunnelLayout title="The Booked Artist System | Tattoo Booking Tools" description="More of the work you want to be booked for. Build toward better income, bigger projects, and clients who seek you out. By Joker Ink. Working System: $47 once." pageType="booked_artist_system_landing" structuredData={structuredData}>
  <Fragment slot="header"><a class="fq-skip" href="#bas-main">Skip to the system</a><FunnelHeader /></Fragment>
  <div class="fq-page" id="bas-main">
    <div class="fq-container">
      <div class="fq-guide-access" id="fq-guide-access" hidden><span>Your free guide is ready.</span><a id="fq-guide-link" href="/lp/before-you-quote">Open Before You Quote</a></div>
      <section class="fq-sales-intro" aria-labelledby="sales-title">
        <h1 class="fq-sales-heading" id="sales-title">MORE OF THE WORK<br /><em>YOU WANT TO BE BOOKED FOR.</em></h1>
        <p id="fq-personal-intro">{SALES_INTRO}</p>
      </section>
      <div id="buy">
        {tiers.map(tier=><section class="fq-main-offer" id={`tier-${tier.id}`} data-offer={tier.id} hidden={!tier.recommended} aria-labelledby={`title-${tier.id}`}>
          <TemplateStack count={tier.count} name={tier.name} />
          <div class="fq-offer-copy">
            <p class="fq-match-label" data-match-label>{tier.recommended ? 'OUR RECOMMENDATION':'YOUR SELECTED EDITION'}</p>
            <h2 class="fq-offer-title" id={`title-${tier.id}`}>{tier.name.toUpperCase()}</h2>
            <p class="fq-offer-price">${tier.price}</p>
            <p class="fq-offer-count">{tier.count} numbered tools + guides</p>
            <p class="fq-offer-description">{EDITIONS[tier.id as keyof typeof EDITIONS].description}</p>
            <a class="fq-button" href={tier.checkoutUrl || `#fq-checkout-status-${tier.id}`} data-checkout={Boolean(tier.checkoutUrl)} data-tier={tier.id} data-track="true" data-track-event={tier.checkoutUrl?'booked_artist_checkout_started':'booked_artist_checkout_unavailable'} data-track-label={tier.name} data-track-location="matched_offer" data-track-destination={tier.checkoutUrl || `#fq-checkout-status-${tier.id}`}>GET {tier.name.toUpperCase()} · ${tier.price}</a>
            <p class="fq-guarantee">One payment. 30-day guarantee.</p>
            <!-- Availability follows the selected edition. -->
            {!tier.checkoutUrl && <p class="fq-small" id={`fq-checkout-status-${tier.id}`}>This edition is not open yet. <a href="mailto:syd@tatassist.com">Ask about access</a>.</p>}
            <p class="fq-offer-reason" data-match-reason hidden></p>
          </div>
        </section>)}
      </div>
    </div>
    <section class="fq-framework fq-container" aria-labelledby="framework-title">
      <h2 id="framework-title">LET YOUR BOOKINGS CATCH UP WITH YOUR WORK.</h2>
      <p>Imagine looking at next month’s calendar and seeing pieces you’re excited to create. Clients who came to you for your work. Income that makes the hours you’ve put into your art feel worthwhile.</p>
      <p>That starts with giving the career you want a place in the decisions you make today. The Booked Artist System helps you put that shift into practice, so the work you want has a place in the business you’re building.</p>
      <p class="fq-small">Built to adapt to your working style and your goals.</p>
    </section>
    <section class="fq-loss-band" aria-labelledby="cost-title"><div class="fq-container"><h2 id="cost-title">MORE LEADS. SAME PATTERN. <em>BIGGER BILL.</em></h2><p>A quiet calendar makes more leads tempting. A full calendar of the wrong work can keep you stuck. If promising inquiries go nowhere, more ad spend can make that pattern more expensive. Put a process behind the interest you get.</p></div></section>
    <section class="fq-founder fq-container" aria-labelledby="founder-title">
      <h2 id="founder-title">“I DON’T KNOW IF I’D STILL BE TATTOOING.”</h2>
      <p>I spent years on my drawings and designs. But the biggest level up in my career came when I moved intake out of DMs and changed how I made decisions about clients. I don’t know if I’d still have a career tattooing, much less a successful one, without that shift.</p>
      <p>I know what it feels like to take work because the money is there. I also know what it feels like to be sought out for my work, make thousands in a day, and have happy clients give me more than I asked. These frameworks came from that experience.</p>
      <p class="fq-small">Joker Ink · 18 years tattooing · Studio owner</p>
      <a href="https://www.instagram.com/jokerinkx3/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">@jokerinkx3</a>
      <span aria-hidden="true"> · </span><a href="https://www.bdcustomtattoos.com/joker" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">See my tattoo work</a>
      <BrandLogo class="fq-watermark" alt="" loading="lazy" />
    </section>
    <footer class="fq-sales-footer"><div class="fq-container">
      <p class="fq-formats"><span>Original PNGs</span><span>Numbered PDFs</span><span>Workbook</span><span>Setup guides</span><span>Individual artist license</span></p>
      <div class="fq-secondary-row">{tiers.map(t=><a href={`?edition=${t.id}#buy`} data-edition-link={t.id} hidden={t.recommended}>{t.name} · {t.count} tools · ${t.price}</a>)}<a class="fq-terms" href="/lp/booked-artist/terms">30-day satisfaction guarantee</a></div>
      <details class="fq-sales-details"><summary>A few questions before you buy</summary>{faqs.map(f=><div class="fq-faq-item"><h3>{f.question}</h3><p>{f.answer}</p></div>)}</details>
      <div class="fq-quiz-footer"><BrandLogo class="fq-footer-logo" loading="lazy" /><a href="/lp/before-you-quote">Take the free booking check</a><a href="/privacy">Privacy</a></div>
    </div></footer>
    <div class="fq-mobile-buy"><a class="fq-button" id="fq-mobile-cta" href="#tier-working">GET WORKING SYSTEM · $47</a></div>
  </div>
  <script>import '../../scripts/offer-result.js';</script>
</FunnelLayout>
